  "fdLines": [
    {
      "day": 62,
      "line": "🍖 FEAST 📺 — Liam opens the pantry wide: 5× Foraged food, 1× Foraged food. Wenhao eat until the fire burns low. Somebody tells the story again, the one everybody already knows. For one evening, hunger feels like a rumor. (−1,500 kcal from the pantry) The channeled keepsake feeds the feast — the feast was the weapon, and the surge rides the fire until tomorrow's dawn, spent only when the blades are warmed. (FEAST SURGE ×1.5 armed)"
    },
    {
      "day": 62,
      "line": "🍖 FEASTED ×2.03 until tomorrow's dawn (6 parts left): a proper feast. A channeled keepsake feeds the flames (devotion ×1.5). Strikes and abilities hit with the feast behind them."
    },
    {
      "day": 62,
      "line": "🌙 The cookfire's smell carried further than the laughter did — smoke and grease on the night wind. Big Loud is circling the edge of the light. It followed the feast here. (A scavenger, drawn by the feast. Face it while the feast is in you — or let the watch drive it off.)"
    },
